const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究法律制度、投资者权利与金融发展指标之间的跨国关系。 阅读时先把它理解为一个被界定的问题，而不是可以脱离样本、时间和制度环境的结论。",en:"The paper studies cross-country relations among legal systems, investor rights, and financial-development indicators. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"来源使用国家层面的法律起源、权利和金融发展指标进行比较，制度分类是研究设计的一部分。 这说明比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系是研究合同的一部分；改变其中任何一项，都可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It compares country-level legal origin, rights, and financial development; institutional classification is part of the design. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"需要国家口径、法律与权利变量版本、金融发展指标、观察年份及原始编码规则。 数据字段、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原始研究分开记录，不能仅凭同名变量或最终修订数据就视为可比。",en:"Use country definitions, legal-and-rights variable versions, financial-development measures, observation years, and original coding rules. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"论文描述跨国制度与金融结果的关系；相关性和制度分类不应被改写为单一公司的治理结论。 它支持的是该来源所描述的经验或理论关系；它本身不把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"It reports country-level institutional relationships; correlation and classification should not become a single firm's governance conclusion. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not convert association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"保留法律编码版本和国家样本，区分法律文本、执行强度和市场发展指标，并记录历史边界和缺失处理。 在做后续分析前，应把这些选择写入版本化的研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Preserve legal-coding version and country sample; distinguish legal text, enforcement, and market-development measures; record historical boundaries and missingness. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 Journal of Political Economy (1998)。国家层级的历史比较不能替代任何司法辖区当前的法律意见、监管状态或公司层面的因果判断。 若需要量化结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites Journal of Political Economy (1998). Country-level historical comparisons are not current legal advice, a regulatory-status assessment, or a firm-level causal conclusion. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1086/250042",label:{zh:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · 来源说明",en:"Journal of Political Economy (1998) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Law and Finance”所公开说明的研究问题与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。国家层级的历史比较不能替代任何司法辖区当前的法律意见、监管状态或公司层面的因果判断。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Law and Finance”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
